00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.430
purchased their box lunch suppers,

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:40.330
and are on their way to their target.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.660
See, this is Navigator.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:07.500
Your initial heading, 337 Magnetic.

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:26.850
...skirts of Deerfield on a vacant lot is a radar system mounted on top of two adjoining trailers.

