00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:34.660
Locked in by radar to these sensitive instruments, the precise course of the plane is charted

00:22:34.660 --> 00:22:39.320
until the instant when their harmless electronic bomb is released upon the target.

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:29.780
Deterrence is a perishable thing.

00:23:30.730 --> 00:23:32.250
It must be worked at constantly.

00:23:32.670 --> 00:23:37.600
In this business, there isn't much difference between self-satisfaction and surrender.

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:42.350
If you can fly Mach 2 today, how fast can you fly tomorrow?

00:23:43.300 --> 00:23:46.760
If you hit the pickle barrel today, how about the pickle tomorrow?

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:49.180
They'll be back tomorrow to see.

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:51.810
Deterrence is a philosophy.

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:55.750
Keep the peace by being strong enough to destroy the attacker.

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:59.610
Deterrence is a bomb and a vehicle to deliver it.

00:24:01.590 --> 00:24:29.960
But the most important of all ingredients in the deterrent concept is the one provided by the people, the will. The will behind the concept. A public will to use the bomb and the vehicle, if it comes to that, to preserve a thing we call human dignity. For the enemy will not be deterred by all the planes, missiles, bombs, and men in the world if he thinks we are lacking in the will to use it.

00:24:31.280 --> 00:24:32.960
Sonic booms are a nuisance.

00:24:33.630 --> 00:24:36.710
The men who make them know it and regret it as much as anyone.

00:24:37.180 --> 00:24:40.520
But to accept them as one of the necessary costs of being free

00:24:40.520 --> 00:24:43.890
is perhaps the very best way of demonstrating to the enemy

00:24:43.890 --> 00:24:45.930
our intention of remaining that way.

00:24:46.460 --> 00:24:49.160
As long as our planes are in the sky and not on the ground,

00:24:49.180 --> 00:24:52.980
as long as the boom continues, we stand prepared.

00:24:53.440 --> 00:24:59.970
The sound of the boom has become the sound of necessity and protection.

00:25:01.080 --> 00:25:02.660
sound of your head.
